    "en": "From fruit cards to dots",
    "bn": "ফলের কার্ড থেকে বিন্দু"
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": "Read each fruit row, carry size and sweetness to the plot, and preserve its label colour."
  },
  "pseudocode": [
    "for each card p in input order:",
    "    read size and sweetness from its row",
    "    mark that row so the two features stay together",
    "    plot p at (size, sweetness), coloured by its label",
    "count all cards and the cards of each label"
